'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">微软拟于下周Build大会发布全新自研代码及多场景AI模型</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">04</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">企业级AI搜索独角兽Glean年化营业收入突破3亿美元大关</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">05</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">三菱日联金融集团向3.5万名员工全面部署ChatGPT Enterprise</span></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:10px auto;text-align:center;\"><section style=\"display:inline-block;\"><section style=\"margin-top:-4px;padding:0 40px;outline:0;font-size:24px;letter-spacing:1.5px;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\">新闻速览</span></strong></section><section style=\"margin-top:-2px;width:182px;height:2px;background-color:rgb(58,19,228);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"margin-top:3px;width:182px;height:1px;background-color:rgb(111,19,209);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"outline:0;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:1.5px;color:rgb(92,11,214);transform:scale(.9);\"><span leaf=\"\">NEWS GLANCE</span></section></section></section><section id=\"xiangqing\"><section id=\"content1\"><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">阿波罗与黑石筹资360亿美元，为Anthropic租赁谷歌TPU芯片</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/6125686a72adff615a40c0379ea677c4.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">阿波罗全球管理公司与黑石集团正联合发起一项规模约360亿美元的债务融资交易，旨在为AI独角兽Anthropic构建人工智能基础设施提供资金。该交易采取“以租代买”模式，专项用于购买谷歌定制化AI芯片TPU，并由Anthropic通过租赁方式获取算力。博通公司为该交易中规模最大的部分付款提供信用背书，确保Anthropic获得稳定的算力供应。此次融资刷新了全球芯片债务交易的最高纪录，标志着大模型军备竞赛已进入比拼底层算力资源与资本整合能力的新阶段。受此消息影响，博通盘后股价一度拉升1.9%，Alphabet股价上涨1.2%。该模式通过金融创新解决了AI企业对高性能计算资源的迫切需求，为行业提供了新的算力获取范式。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">谷歌DeepMind CEO哈萨比斯预测AGI最快将于2029至2030年间实现</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/84449dc887a89f3a0bbb15a35f6a0730.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">谷歌DeepMind首席执行官德米斯·哈萨比斯近日公开表示，通用人工智能（AGI）的研发进程显著加速，预计最快在2029年至2030年间即可实现，即关键技术突破可能在未来三年内落地。哈萨比斯指出，当前多模态理解、自主决策及AI智能体等核心技术的快速成熟，正为AGI的到来奠定基础。他强调，AGI的演进是一个持续升级的过程，而非单一的突发奇点。与专用AI不同，AGI具备跨领域的学习、推理与创造能力，一旦落地将重塑全球生产力格局。同时，哈萨比斯发出警示，鉴于未来AI系统将具备自我优化与自主迭代能力，全球政府及社会在规则制定与防护机制上的准备严重不足，适应技术变革的时间窗口已十分紧迫。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">微软拟于下周Build大会发布全新自研代码及多场景AI模型</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/0abdab7b4d7ad50812eef5efd682ce06.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">微软计划在下周旧金山Build开发者大会上发布多款自研AI模型，旨在完善自有AI体系并降低对外部供应商的依赖。针对GitHub Copilot面临的市场竞争，微软将推出一款高性价比代码专用模型，作为Claude的平价替代方案。此外，微软还将发布涵盖语音转写、逻辑推理、语音处理及图像生成等场景的全新迭代模型，并通过Azure云平台向开发者开放采购。此次战略调整标志着微软正加速摆脱对OpenAI和Anthropic模型的深度依赖，意在通过自研模型矩阵降低GitHub Copilot及Microsoft 365 Copilot的内部运营成本。随着OpenAI技术使用权到期节点临近，微软此举预示着大模型市场竞争正从单纯的能力比拼，转向深度的成本控制与生态应用对决，以应对日益激烈的市场竞争格局。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">企业级AI搜索独角兽Glean年化营业收入突破3亿美元大关</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/117a18929fbbd68b6b16c7d6e8c7e4f6.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">企业级AI搜索初创公司Glean宣布其年化营业收入（ARR）正式突破3亿美元，较此前跨越1亿美元里程碑仅耗时15个月，实现三倍增长。Glean通过构建“上下文图谱（Context Graph）”技术，深度连接并学习企业内部软件系统，使其AI模型能精准理解业务需求，在企业级搜索领域构筑了核心技术壁垒。面对谷歌、微软、OpenAI等巨头竞争，Glean凭借该技术显著降低了企业调用大模型的Token消耗，从而大幅削减计算成本。这一“省钱”优势使其成功吸引了Databricks、Reddit、Pinterest及三星等重量级客户。Glean的增长证明，在AI预算管控日益严格的背景下，能够精准锁定内部信息并优化计算效率的垂直化AI搜索解决方案，正成为企业数字化转型的关键基础设施。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">三菱日联金融集团向3.5万名员工全面部署ChatGPT Enterprise</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/586ea7f7c8e46311aad7a53a6bebca82.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">三菱日联金融集团（MUFG）正式向旗下三菱日联银行约3.5万名员工全面部署ChatGPT Enterprise，标志着该集团向“AI-native”企业转型。自2024年10月与OpenAI合作以来，MUFG通过全员培训及定制化GPT工作坊，支持员工自主创建超1800个“AI银行家”工具。数据显示，该举措使员工在研究任务及简报准备中的工作量减少20%至30%。此外，MUFG计划在数字银行品牌emutt中推出由AI驱动的“AI礼宾”服务及多资产咨询平台，实现24/7个性化金融服务。管理层表示，AI的应用旨在将员工从繁琐工作中解放，投入到更具人文关怀的客户服务与决策审批中，通过构建AI原生生态重塑零售金融体验。</section></section></section></section><section style=\"text-align:center;\"><img data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.4255555555555556\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"900\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\"></section>",
